      "writtenOn": "2021-03-06T00:16:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This should be fine for this initial version, but isn\u0027t ideal. I wish `vm` had the following commands.\n\nvm start\nvm stop\nvm list",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 60,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 61,
        "endChar": 58
      },
      "revId": "3bc7312ee6474fecf708b38e992ac8fb971e0cf4",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "e115217d_c590b094",
        "filename": "vm/src/main.rs",
        "patchSetId": 8
      },
      "lineNbr": 61,
      "author": {
        "id": 1380243
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-03-08T17:33:27Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "For the first two to be possible with the current Virt Manager model, it would have to spawn some kind of background service.\n\nWhat would you want \u0027list` to do? Virt Manager intentionally doesn\u0027t allow one process to see anything about a VM started by another process, unless the process which created it passes the Binder handle over itself.",
      "parentUuid": "5d03c34a_8ea4432d",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 60,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 61,
        "endChar": 58
      },
      "revId": "3bc7312ee6474fecf708b38e992ac8fb971e0cf4",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "7af0cbfc_3e2b5df4",
        "filename": "vm/src/main.rs",
        "patchSetId": 8
      },
      "lineNbr": 61,
      "author": {
        "id": 1132673
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-03-08T17:51:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "without `vm list`, how can one refer to the instance of VM to be shut-down when calling `vm stop`?",
      "parentUuid": "e115217d_c590b094",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 60,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 61,
        "endChar": 58
      },
      "revId": "3bc7312ee6474fecf708b38e992ac8fb971e0cf4",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "47bcc6fb_4e4d4db4",
        "filename": "vm/src/main.rs",
        "patchSetId": 8
      },
      "lineNbr": 61,
