      "writtenOn": "2021-03-08T18:02:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hmm, I don\u0027t understand why the management of VM should have such a restriction.\n\nSee `acloud`. We have `acloud [create|list|delete]`. See the commercial tools like virtualbox. It provides menus for users to create a VM, see the existing ones, and stop/destroy one from the list.\n\nAnyway, I think this discussion is out of scope of this CL. We can continue the discussion later on the doc, or elsewhere. :)",
